	(text_box "Idle = (I +a, Q 0): a carrier at 0 deg that the far end's loop tracks.  BPSK: I to -a.  QPSK: (+-a,\n+-a).  FSK: the four phases in turn at +-df.  OOK: both at 0.  Each ladder gives -a / 0 / +a as 00 /\n01,10 / 11 (a = 0.33 V single-ended about the 0.5 V bias; sim/budget.py section 1)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.3200 24.1300 0) (size 91.4400 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
		(fill (type color) (color 255 255 194 1)) (effects (font (size 1.00 1.00)) (justify left top)) (uuid "edd8acb6-41bb-5cfd-2b59-80e2835b67a1"))
	(text_box "Blue boxes: what is on the wire beside them (frequency | level | bandwidth | DC), computed by\nsim/budget.py for the 10 m bench link with 2 dBi whips (the DSA then at 5.25 dB, holding the\ndemodulator at -20 dBm); the same numbers as docs/images/block_*.svg." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.3200 33.0200 0) (size 83.8200 7.6200)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
