	(text_box "IBBN / QBBN: 0.507 V DC (4.7k\n/ 750R from 3.3 V, 1 uF; the\npins' own 2 x 41 uA included)\n| the differential drive is\nthen +-0.33 V  VR_I / VR_Q\n(the DAC) centre each ladder\nand null the carrier for OOK\ntests." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 140.9700 87.6300 0) (size 29.2100 16.5100)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type default))
