	(text_box "TX ANT, 50 ohm SMA:\n5.8 GHz (5.15-5.875\nusable) | +9.8 dBm\n(1964 mV p-p) to the\nantenna, the PA or SW\nTX | a CW line; a flip\nadds +-100 MHz skirts\n| never into RX ANT.\nInto the\nSBB5089+SE5004 5.8 GHz\n2 W module (40 dB,\nP1dB +33 dBm out) ONLY\nthrough a 20 dB pad:\nits input must stay\nunder -7 dBm" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 415.2900 78.7400 0) (size 25.4000 27.9400)
