	(text_box "25 MHz TCXO +-2.5 ppm (TC32H4,\nLVCMOS): the TX reference.\nTwo boards' carriers then\ndiffer by at most 29 kHz." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 8.8900 293.3700 0) (size 33.0200 10.1600)
