	(text_box "JP201 REF: TCXO (default) or REF\nIN (SMA, 10-210 MHz, 0.7 V p-p\nmin; fit 49.9 ohm for a 50 ohm\nsource).  Lock two boards to one\nreference on the bench to take the\nfrequency offset out of the\nexperiment." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.4800 317.5000 0) (size 31.7500 15.2400)
