	(text_box "TX synthesizer: MAX2871, 5.8 GHz integer-N from 25\nMHz (N = 232; the far end's RX sits 50 MHz away),\nRFOUTA differential into the ADL5375's LO, RFOUTB to\nthe LO TX MON jack.  Its own LDO, +3V3_PLL_TX." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 72.3900 209.5500 0) (size 46.9900 10.1600)
