	(text_box "DNP 0R to TX_Q1: fit it, and\nset the FPGA's TX_Q1 pin to an\ninput, to step the transmitter\nstraight from TRIG IN to +Q:\nthe link's latency without\neither FPGA (TRIG IN MON here,\nQP MON on the far board)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 483.8700 349.2500 0) (size 29.2100 15.2400)
