	(text_box "TRIG IN: a detector pulse (3.3 V logic;\n1k series protects the Schmitt input;\nJP202 terminates it in 50 ohm) starts\nthe FPGA's latency counter.  TRIG A / B:\nthe FPGA marks the symbol it sent or the\none it decoded; board-to-board latency\nis TRIG A here against TRIG B there on\nthe scope." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 407.6700 359.4100 0) (size 38.1000 16.5100)
